## Installed native CLI through the actual local router: PASS 6/6

`harness/routed_native_e2e.py` starts only the production RouterHandler on an
owned loopback server with isolated configuration, then launches installed
Claude 2.1.306 and Codex 0.158.0/0.163.0 with native router-path retries zero.
`harness/routed-native-e2e.json` records six passing cases at
2026-10-21T19:49:39Z: each CLI sends exactly one HTTP request to the router;
503 -> success produces exactly two upstream requests and one CLI success;
persistent 503 produces exactly four upstream requests and one CLI failure.
All retry payload digests stay equal, no tool execution is observed, owned
listeners close, and all six captured source digests match the working tree.
This exercises the real RouterHttpHandler dispatch, not just adapter calls.
No production provider or existing session was contacted or reset.

# Review follow-through

- Strict transient 429 now spends the same allowance, not a separate legacy
  key/backoff loop: real loopback 429 -> success is 2 hits; persistent 429 is
  4 with limit 3; usage/malformed 429 is 1. Explicit zero remains 1 even with
  multiple configured keys. Generic-provider rotation tests remain unchanged.
- Claude native output-budget 400 recovery uses a copied disabled config for
  its one changed-body attempt. 400 -> 200/503/400 all issue exactly two hits,
  never a local stopped-budget 500 or third replay.
- Router SSE recovery additionally requires a readable nonempty paired private
  queue. Missing, empty, directory or undecodable queues cannot authorize a
  restart from old status rows. This probe establishes file presence, not
  queued-ID overlap; the observer supplies the complete-history count/age.
- `test_runtime_sse_recovery.py` now has 28 passing tests, including actual
  status/queue files and the real restart service over HTTP MCP. The request
  is durably queued with resume=true, cooldown blocks a second request, and
  source queue/status/cursor bytes and mtimes stay unchanged. It does not
  exercise an actual native CLI restart.
- Final exact-file combined sweep: 709 tests, 12 skipped, no failures;
  repository ruff, compileall and documentation metadata checks pass.

